@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData data governance and compliance
left to right direction
rectangle "Source or dependency change" as Change
rectangle "Licence / terms review" as Review
rectangle "Security and privacy classification" as Classify
rectangle "Documentation and notices" as Notices
rectangle "Build / runtime evidence" as Evidence
rectangle "Release decision" as Decision
diamond "Mandatory controls satisfied?" as Gate
Change --> Review
Review --> Classify
Classify --> Notices
Notices --> Evidence
Evidence --> Gate
Gate --> Decision : yes
Gate --> Change : no / remediate
note bottom of Gate
Checklists are not evidence by themselves.
Unresolved blockers require an explicit decision.
end note
@enduml
